    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Image Credits &amp; AI Visuals | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Learn how KASODI credits photography and uses AI-assisted imagery in its editorial and product content."
    />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://kasodi.com/image-credits-ai-visuals/" />
  </head>

  <body>
    <Header />

    <main class="policy-page">
      <header class="policy-hero">
        <h1>Image Credits &amp; AI Visuals</h1>
        <p class="policy-intro">At KASODI, we believe that beautiful interiors begin with thoughtful choices. Our editorial approach brings together carefully selected products, natural materials, and visual inspiration designed to help our readers discover objects for everyday living.</p>
        <p class="policy-updated">Last updated: <time datetime="2026-11-15">15 November 2026</time></p>
      </header>

      <div class="policy-content">
        <section class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
          <div>
            <h2>Photography and Visual Content</h2>
            <p>KASODI features a combination of brand-provided photography, authorised visual materials, and selected images created or enhanced with artificial intelligence (AI).</p>
            <p>Images are used for editorial inspiration and product presentation. Where applicable, the original brand or image source is credited.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
          <div>
            <h2>AI-Generated and AI-Assisted Imagery</h2>
            <p>Some lifestyle images featured on KASODI are generated or enhanced using artificial intelligence.</p>
            <p>These visuals are intended to illustrate how selected products may appear in different interior settings, lighting conditions, and decorative compositions.</p>
            <p>When creating AI-assisted product visuals, we aim to maintain the essential appearance of the featured products, including their overall shape, proportions, colours, materials, and recognisable design features.</p>
            <p>However, AI-generated images are illustrative representations and should not be considered exact photographic reproductions of the original products.</p>
            <p>Variations in colour, texture, scale, lighting, or decorative details may occur.</p>
            <p>Where applicable, AI-generated or AI-manipulated content is identified through appropriate disclosures.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
          <div>
            <h2>Product Accuracy</h2>
            <p>KASODI makes reasonable efforts to present product information accurately, using available details from manufacturers and retailers.</p>
            <p>Product specifications, measurements, materials, finishes, prices, and availability may change or differ between markets.</p>
            <p>Visitors are encouraged to consult the manufacturer's or retailer's official product page for the latest information before making a purchase.</p>
            <p>AI-generated imagery should not be relied upon to determine exact product dimensions, construction, or technical characteristics.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
          <div>
            <h2>Brand Ownership and Image Rights</h2>
            <p>Product names, trademarks, logos, and brand identities belong to their respective owners.</p>
            <p>Brand-provided images and other third-party visual materials are used subject to applicable permissions, licences, and affiliate programme conditions.</p>
            <p>AI-generated editorial visuals are created independently unless otherwise indicated.</p>
            <p>The appearance of a product or brand on KASODI does not, by itself, imply that the brand has approved, sponsored, or endorsed the editorial content.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
          <div>
            <h2>Editorial Independence and Affiliate Relationships</h2>
            <p>KASODI is an independent editorial and affiliate platform.</p>
            <p>Our selections reflect our editorial approach to considered living, design, and everyday objects.</p>
            <p>Some links on our website are affiliate links. If a visitor makes a qualifying purchase through one of these links, KASODI may receive a commission at no additional cost to the customer.</p>
            <p>Affiliate relationships do not change the manufacturer's responsibility for product specifications, availability, fulfilment, or customer service.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number" aria-hidden="true">06</span>
          <div>
            <h2>Transparency and Updates</h2>
            <p>We are committed to responsible use of AI-assisted visual content and clear communication with our readers.</p>
            <p>We may update this policy to reflect changes in our editorial practices, applicable laws, or the requirements of our commercial partners.</p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>

<style>

  .policy-page {
    background: #f8f5ef;
    color: #29251f;
  }


  .policy-hero {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 110px 40px 100px;
    text-align: center;
  }



  .policy-hero h1 {
    margin: 0 auto 35px;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 6vw, 78px);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }


  .policy-intro {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #5e574d;
  }


  .policy-updated {
    margin: 30px 0 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #8b8378;
  }


  .policy-content {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 20px 40px 120px;
  }


  .policy-section {
    padding: 60px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(41, 37, 31, 0.15);

    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 90px 1fr;
    gap: 45px;
  }


  .policy-number {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: #917552;
  }


  .policy-section > div {
    max-width: 760px;
  }


  .policy-section h2 {
    margin: 0 0 25px;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 400;
  }


  .policy-section p {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: #5d564c;
  }


  @media (max-width: 700px) {

    .policy-hero,
    .policy-content {
      padding-left: 22px;
      padding-right: 22px;
    }


    .policy-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 45px 0;
    }


    .policy-hero {
      padding-top: 70px;
      padding-bottom: 70px;
    }

  }

</style>
